# Agent Instructions

Use UI UX Pro Max rules before making UI/UX changes.

Project type:
Vite/React website for SurahaEnterprise.

Main goals:
- Premium, modern, dynamic, trustworthy design
- Better navbar
- Cleaner hero section
- Clear page headers on every page
- Visible pricing values
- Strong responsive layout
- Consistent typography scale
- Better spacing and alignment
- Smooth but not excessive animations
- Better accessibility and contrast

Rules:
- Do not rewrite the full project unless asked.
- Improve the existing design step by step.
- Keep business logic and routes working.
- Check mobile, tablet, laptop, and desktop layouts.
- Avoid overlapping text.
- Avoid random colours and inconsistent font sizes.
- Use professional icons, clean cards, strong CTAs, and clear section hierarchy.

Before finalising:
- run npm run build
- fix any build errors
- confirm navbar, hero, pricing, page headers, and responsiveness are improved
